---

<section class="smart-colors" aria-labelledby="smart-colors-title">
  <h2 id="smart-colors-title">Smart Colors — wallpaper → palette → apps</h2>
  <div class="flow" role="img" aria-label="Smart Colors flow: wallpaper to apps">
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-box">Wallpaper</div>
      <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="flow-box">Color extraction</div>
      <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="flow-box">Semantic palette</div>
      <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="flow-box">Quickshell / Hyprland / terminal / apps</div>
    </div>
    <p class="flow-caption">
      Los colores se extraen del wallpaper y se aplican automáticamente a Quickshell, Hyprland, terminal y apps vía
      Material Design 3. Respeta <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> y tiene fallback estático.
    </p>
    <div class="flow-controls">
      <button type="button" class="flow-btn" aria-label="Pausar animación">⏸ Pausar</button>
      <button type="button" class="flow-btn" aria-label="Reproducir animación">▶ Reproducir</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <details>
    <summary>Descripción textual del flujo</summary>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Wallpaper:</strong> imagen seleccionada por el usuario</li>
      <li><strong>Extracción:</strong> análisis inteligente de paleta</li>
      <li><strong>Paleta semántica:</strong> error, success, warning, info con contraste AA</li>
      <li><strong>Aplicación:</strong> Quickshell, Hyprland, terminal, apps</li>
    </ol>
  </details>
</section>
<style>
  .smart-colors {
    margin: var(--space-8) 0;
  }
  .flow {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }
  .flow-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .flow-box {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-clay);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 200px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .flow-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-clay);
  }
  .flow-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 50ch;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .flow-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .flow-btn {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: white;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .flow-arrow {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
